      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python file that normalizes extracted expense fields into a standard JSON schema using a concrete external provider. The chosen provider for this task is Amazon Comprehend, which is identifiable in the code through the import of the `boto3` library and the use of the `comprehend` client. </thinking>\n",
