      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the `extract_invoice_fields.py` file, I need to choose a concrete external provider for structured document extraction. Amazon Textract is a suitable choice for this task as it provides robust document processing capabilities. I will import the necessary modules from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the `textract` client to interact with the service. The code will include the provider-specific client class and API calls to identify the use of Amazon Textract. </thinking>\n",
